    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eCalculate 65\u003csup\u003e2\u003c/sup\u003e + 72\u003csup\u003e2\u003c/sup\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eKey in \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19439\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q6.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19440\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q5.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19441\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qxsqr.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19441\u0026quot;,260)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19442\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qplus.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19442\u0026quot;,203)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19443\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q7.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19444\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19445\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qxsqr.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19445\u0026quot;,260)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19446\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19446\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe calculator gives 9409.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-1 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_8_1_realnumbersandthepythagoreantheorem_3a_70/f-70-3a-1.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eFind the square root of the answer.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19447\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2nd.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19448\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qsqrt.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19448\u0026quot;,219)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19449\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2nd.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19450\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qans.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19450\u0026quot;,107)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19451\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19451\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe calculator gives 97.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eSo, we\u0027ve verified that 65\u003csup\u003e2\u003c/sup\u003e + 72\u003csup\u003e2\u003c/sup\u003e \u003d 97\u003csup\u003e2\u003c/sup\u003e. This means (65, 72, 97) is a Pythagorean triple.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-3 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_8_1_realnumbersandthepythagoreantheorem_3a_70/f-70-3a-2.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
